{"version":1,"key":"card:19","content":{"id":19,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"当通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"const","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 声明变量时，类型会被收缩为字面量类型","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ae4d0fbe-9ca1-4bdf-a537-f548acc81be0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const a = \"Hello\";","collabId":"4c0828a4-d6c8-4e26-a4d3-376b6a1c8a4f","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a88f7466-618c-4a06-98ac-99cf1b2d5e57","language":"TypeScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c21f83ec-49de-47a1-be71-706714e41a5b"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ece742c6-3253-42bb-a8f2-1e8594972d24","naturalHeight":401,"naturalWidth":1414,"pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5832e6b4-f629-4c95-9921-6c327e509eb4.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_5832e6b4-f629-4c95-9921-6c327e509eb4.png","uuid":"eddae061-48b9-42b8-9750-ebe585426ecc","width":731.4285714285714},{"children":[{"text":"当使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"let","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 声明类型时，不会收缩为字面量类型，也比较合理，毕竟声明为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"let ","type":"formatted"},{"text":"就表示可以继续被赋值，收缩为字面量没有意义。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b5e2d3be-934c-43d8-b96c-acbe83840b29","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"let a = \"Hello\";","collabId":"e76c1900-6ca9-4030-b4a5-85575065e4e7","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d6